| General any-state (default) rules
&nbsp~ ~ | no break (required) space - frequently entered w/o ";" in old HTML
| Sensing beginning of native txx command (in any state):
|028~|028~~10~(~ | to state 10 & push current state
| state 10 - copy all, reverting to prior state after |031:
|031~|031~10~~)~
